OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for rapes and other
OL,4,Achild sex offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "vile" paedophile who carried out a
OL,7,Fnumber of offences, including raping a
OL,8,Fchild and forcing another to look at
OL,9,Fimages of a sexual nature, has been
OL,10,Fjailed for 21 years.
OL,12,FJason Lear, 48, of Bideford Crescent,
OL,13,FFilwood, was sentenced at Bristol Crown
OL,14,FCourt on Monday for offences including
OL,15,Ffive counts of rape against one victim,
OL,16,Fthree of which were committed when the
OL,17,Fvictim was under 16.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
