OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for rapes and other
OL,4,Achild sex offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FDescribing Lear's behaviour towards
OL,7,Ffemales as "vile", DC James Clynes,
OL,8,Ffrom Avon and Somerset Police said: "He
OL,9,Fobjectified females for his own
OL,10,Fpleasure and had no regard for them as
OL,11,Fhuman beings."
OL,13,FIn a statement, one victim said due to
OL,14,FLear's actions, they now had to "live a
OL,15,Flife of anxiety and fear".
